  data: {
    LLM: "1. Bidding: one chance each, min 7 max 14. Dealer forced to bid 7 if all pass. 2. High bidder names trump. 3. All discard non-trumps. Dealer fills others to 6; dealer takes trumps from remainder (may have >6). 4. High bidder leads. 5. Trump rank: A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-5(pedro)-other 5(low pedro)-4-3-2. 6. Points: high(1), jack(1), ten(1), pedro(5), low pedro(5), low(1) = 14 total. Trump 2 point goes to holder's team.",
    Player: "1. Bidding: one chance each, min 7 max 14. Dealer forced to bid 7 if all pass. 2. High bidder names trump. 3. All discard non-trumps. Dealer fills others to 6; dealer takes trumps from remainder (may have >6). 4. High bidder leads. 5. Trump rank: A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-5(pedro)-other 5(low pedro)-4-3-2. 6. Points: high(1), jack(1), ten(1), pedro(5), low pedro(5), low(1) = 14 total. Trump 2 point goes to holder's team.",
    objective: 'Bid 7-14; choose trump; win at least bid points. First to 62 wins.',
    gameplay: "1. Bidding: one chance each, min 7 max 14. Dealer forced to bid 7 if all pass. 2. High bidder names trump. 3. All discard non-trumps. Dealer fills others to 6; dealer takes trumps from remainder (may have >6). 4. High bidder leads. 5. Trump rank: A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-5(pedro)-other 5(low pedro)-4-3-2. 6. Points: high(1), jack(1), ten(1), pedro(5), low pedro(5), low(1) = 14 total. Trump 2 point goes to holder's team.",
    keyRules: [
      'Pedro = trump 5 (5 pts). Low pedro = other 5 same colour (5 pts).',
